        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(reply): prevent foreground delivery deadlock",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWhatsApp replies could finish model generation but remain undelivered when a newer same-session inbound arrived during the previous turn's final delivery. The foreground freshness fence waited for the newer generation, while queued follow-up admission waited for the older owner's delivery barrier, creating a circular wait. A later inbound could re-kick the queue and make the stranded reply appear.\n\nCloses #99061.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nKeep stale-reply suppression for independent newer turns, but temporarily suspend only the queued generation whose admission is explicitly waiting on the older owner's delivery barrier. The dispatch-scoped callback travels with each `FollowupRun`, including collect and overflow-summary transformations, so an active drain cannot reuse a stale runner closure's fence identity. Fence snapshots also retain their state identity so a delayed callback cannot collide with a recreated generation number.\n\n## User Impact\n\nConcurrent WhatsApp messages no longer strand the previous completed reply behind a circular delivery/admission wait. Independent newer turns still suppress stale older replies as before. No config, protocol, or plugin API changes.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/auto-reply/reply/queue/drain.identity-guard.test.ts` — 2 tests passed.\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/auto-reply/dispatch.freshness.test.ts src/auto-reply/dispatch.test.ts src/auto-reply/reply/dispatch-from-config.reply-dispatch.test.ts src/auto-reply/reply/reply-flow.test.ts src/auto-reply/reply/reply-turn-admission.test.ts src/auto-reply/reply/followup-runner.test.ts` — 179 tests passed.\n- `node scripts/run-oxlint.mjs` on all 11 changed files — passed.\n- Testbox-through-Crabbox `tbx_01kwrhrwx9whq4h8c2rwqmvzms` — exact 11-file `check:changed` overlay passed; [Actions run](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/28732927268).\n- `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode local --stream-engine-output` — final review clean; no accepted/actionable findings.\n",
